                "value": "=# Market Analysis Report\\n**Symbol**: {{$json[\"symbol\"]}}\\n**Analysis Date**: {{$now}}\\n**Data Sources**: market-detector, price-feed, orderbook, running-trade, today-running-trade, findata\\n**Order Book Source**: price-feed.json (HTTP)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Executive Summary\\n\\n- Daily percentage change: **{{$json[\"percentage_change\"]}}**.\\n- Order book spread: **{{$json[\"spread\"]}}**.\\n- Net foreign from price feed: **{{$json[\"foreign_net\"]}}**, from findata: **{{$json[\"net_foreign_findata\"]}}**.\\n- Bid vs offer depth (total volume): **{{$json[\"depth_bid_total_volume\"]}}** vs **{{$json[\"depth_offer_total_volume\"]}}**.\\n- Total trades today (running trade): **{{$json[\"trade_count\"]}}**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- This report uses pre-computed metrics from upstream APIs and simple aggregations via n8n expressions.\\n- For deeper metrics (trend slope, intraday volatility, etc.), use an external analytics service or LLM fed with the full JSON payload.\\n"
